    "detailed_description": "<h1>The Prequel</h1><p></p><br><h1>Check other games:</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>Add to your wishlist!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834960/extras/ed825994bd214290073ffbe3e8b2be6f.avif?t=1728829568\" /></div><br><br>When you were traveling around the world, someone told you about an anime factory located in some Neko Town. Now this is your way. Perhaps the anime begins here. Is this your place?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834960/extras/fc211e08d129ce5de29817bd04eedd54.avif?t=1728829568\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2>Explore Neko Town looking for hidden objects. Walk down the streets, find new places to get in. Try a variety of mini games like playing darts, picking locks, breaking safes! Try changing your style using character customization. Finally, find the way to get to the anime factory and hack all its computer's data!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834960/extras/08c5e76564af48ab51414df62229adb4.poster.avif?t=1728829568\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834960/extras/08c5e76564af48ab51414df62229adb4.webm?t=1728829568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834960/extras/08c5e76564af48ab51414df62229adb4.mp4?t=1728829568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A short story;<br></li><li> 2D and 3D gameplay;<br></li><li> 12 arts to unlock;<br></li><li> Several mini games;<br></li><li> Character customization;</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Don't forget to add to your wishlist! It's important for devs :)</strong></h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834960/extras/b9b1e7f5757c9416a9a7db1499c2caeb.poster.avif?t=1728829568\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834960/extras/b9b1e7f5757c9416a9a7db1499c2caeb.webm?t=1728829568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834960/extras/b9b1e7f5757c9416a9a7db1499c2caeb.mp4?t=1728829568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Have a look at this DLC!</strong></h2>",
